WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.279 --> 00:00:05.170
For 343’s sake, Dr. Bright, how many times
do we have to tell you, Able is not Kratos!

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:10.570
Look, we will admit that he is an immortal
warrior with incredible combat prowess and

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:14.380
proficiency in a wide variety of weapons,
as well as supernatural strength that makes

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.090
him almost unbeatable in hand-to-hand combat.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:21.110
That does not, however, mean that he’s the
lead character from the popular God of War

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.110
series.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:27.040
We don’t need an Able Vs God fight on our
hands, Jack!

